{\uc1 \u20114 ?}{\uc1 \u32852 ?}{\uc1 \u32593 ?} \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1   }{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 B{\uc1 \u65294 ?}{\uc1 \u24191 ?}{\uc1 \u22495 ?}{\uc1 \u32593 ?} \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?C{\uc1 \u65294 ?}{\uc1 \u22478 ?}{\uc1 \u22495 ?}{\uc1 \u32593 ?} \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?D{\uc1 \u65294 ?}{\uc1 \u23616 ?}{\uc1 \u22495 ?}{\uc1 \u32593 ?}}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 69{\uc1 \u12289 ?}M{\uc1 \u20844 ?}{\uc1 \u21496 ?}{\uc1 \u20026 ?}{\uc1 \u23458 ?}{\uc1 \u25143 ?}{\uc1 \u25552 ?}{\uc1 \u20379 ?}{\uc1 \u32593 ?}{\uc1 \u19978 ?}{\uc1 \u26381 ?}{\uc1 \u21153 ?}{\uc1 \u65292 ?}{\uc1 \u23458 ?}{\uc1 \u25143 ?}{\uc1 \u26377 ?}{\uc1 \u24456 ?}{\uc1 \u22810 ?}{\uc1 \u37325 ?}{\uc1 \u35201 ?}{\uc1 \u30340 ?}{\uc1 \u20449 ?}{\uc1 \u24687 ?}{\uc1 \u38656 ?}{\uc1 \u36890 ?}{\uc1 \u36807 ?}{\uc1 \u27983 ?}{\uc1 \u35272 ?}{\uc1 \u22120 ?}{\uc1 \u19982 ?}{\uc1 \u20844 ?}{\uc1 \u21496 ?}{\uc1 \u20132 ?}{\uc1 \u20114 ?}{\uc1 \u12290 ?}{\uc1 \u20026 ?}{\uc1 \u20445 ?}{\uc1 \u38556 ?}{\uc1 \u36890 ?}{\uc1 \u20449 ?}{\uc1 \u30340 ?}{\uc1 \u23433 ?}{\uc1 \u20840 ?}{\uc1 \u24615 ?}{\uc1 \u65292 ?}{\uc1 \u20854 ?}Web{\uc1 \u26381 ?}{\uc1 \u21153 ?}{\uc1 \u22120 ?}{\uc1 \u24212 ?}{\uc1 \u36873 ?}{\uc1 \u30340 ?}{\uc1 \u21327 ?}{\uc1 \u35758 ?}{\uc1 \u26159 ?}______{\uc1 \u12290 ?}}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1  \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?A{\uc1 \u65294 ?}POP \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?B{\uc1 \u65294 ?}SNMP \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?C{\uc1 \u65294 ?}HTTP }{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1     }{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 D{\uc1 \u65294 ?}HTTPS}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 70{\uc1 \u12289 ?}{\uc1 \u25903 ?}{\uc1 \u25745 ?}{\uc1 \u30528 ?}Internet{\uc1 \u27491 ?}{\uc1 \u24120 ?}{\uc1 \u36816 ?}{\uc1 \u36716 ?}{\uc1 \u30340 ?}{\uc1 \u32593 ?}{\uc1 \u32476 ?}{\uc1 \u20256 ?}{\uc1 \u36755 ?}{\uc1 \u21327 ?}{\uc1 \u35758 ?}{\uc1 \u26159 ?}______{\uc1 \u12290 ?}}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1  \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?A{\uc1 \u65294 ?}TCP/IP \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1   }{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 B{\uc1 \u65294 ?}SNA \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?C{\uc1 \u65294 ?}OSI/RM }{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1    }{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 D{\uc1 \u65294 ?}HTTP}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 Management information systems form. a bedrock of IT use in the public sector. They are therefore found in all sections of the public sector and in all countries. Of course}{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1 , }{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 different people use the term "management information system" differently. The term should therefore not form. the basis for arguments about }{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \cf1 \ul1 71}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1  an MIS is and is not. So long as one and those with whom one works understand and agree on a definition, that is good enough{\uc1 \u65294 ?}Similarly, when dealing with written material, one needs to be able to }{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \cf1 \ul1 72}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1  and communicate, not get locked into doctrinal debate. Many public service providers have developed management information systems to monitor and control the services that they provide. Both the US }{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \cf1 \ul1 73}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1  UK Social Security agencies have developed MIS to report on the welfare payments and services that they provide. The British public healthcare system has also been a major investor in MIS as it tries to control healthcare costs and simultaneously improve delivery standar.Individual schools can also }{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \cf1 \ul1 74}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1  use of MIS. Hob moor Junior and Infant School, a public school in Birmingham, UK, introduced a computerised attendance system to produce MIS reports that monitor pupil attendance{\uc1 \u65294 ?}This improved the Principal's ability to understand and control absence patterns{\uc1 \u65292 ?}resulting in a 2.5 per cent }{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \cf1 \ul1 75}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1  in attendance rates{\uc1 \u65294 ?}}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 71{\uc1 \u12289 ?}A{\uc1 \u65294 ?}what \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?B{\uc1 \u65294 ?}that \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1        }{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 C{\uc1 \u65294 ?}which }{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1        }{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 D{\uc1 \u65294 ?}this}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 72{\uc1 \u12289 ?}A{\uc1 \u65294 ?}look \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?B{\uc1 \u65294 ?}understand \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?C{\uc1 \u65294 ?}get }{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1          }{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 D{\uc1 \u65294 ?}familiar}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 73{\uc1 \u12289 ?}A{\uc1 \u65294 ?}with \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?B{\uc1 \u65294 ?}and \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1          }{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 C{\uc1 \u65294 ?}also }{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1        }{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 D{\uc1 \u65294 ?}to}{\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af4 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 74{\uc1 \u12289 ?}A{\uc1 \u65294 ?}make \uc1 \u160